WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
- Hey guys, it's Inga.

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.350
Today, we're gonna be doing something

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.420
a little bit different.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.120
My friend Ade gave me an ostrich egg.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:08.953
Ta-da!

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.453
He challenged me to make
a giant Egg McMuffin.

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:15.454
(laughing nervously)

00:00:15.454 --> 00:00:17.100
We only have one ostrich egg.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.690
It is not a cheap egg.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.220
The stakes are very high,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.970
but let's make it work.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.700
We're gonna start off by
making the English muffin part.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.180
So I looked up some recipes,

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.092
and I made the dough last night.

00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:31.675
(whimsical big band music)

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.113
So here's the dough.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.793
Flour, moment of truth.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.393
Oh, ho!

00:00:42.393 --> 00:00:44.403
Look at how much air this has.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.123
I'm gonna knead this gently.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.713
Ooh.

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:48.933
It's so smooth.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.590
(whimsical big band music)

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.453
I need to roll this out.

00:00:53.549 --> 00:00:55.716
- [Man] You gotta do that.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.033
- Gotta roll it.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.183
Like pizza.

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:04.375
(light jazzy music)

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.720
That looks pretty decent.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.690
They said sprinkle pretty generously.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:12.100
I think I'm being very generous.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.030
It smells so good.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.510
And we're gonna cut it.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:17.463
Ooh la la.

00:01:17.575 --> 00:01:19.020
Now this is what it looks like right now.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.453
This is the muffin.

00:01:21.046 --> 00:01:22.016
(giggling)

00:01:22.016 --> 00:01:23.610
(clattering)

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:26.870
We're gonna let this prove
for a little over an hour.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.663
We can start working on the ostrich egg.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:30.573
Dun-dun-dun.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:32.913
You hear that?

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:33.863
Like a china plate.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.480
Very smooth.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.580
Even though it has bigger pores than I do.

00:01:38.054 --> 00:01:41.221
(clinking repeatedly)

00:01:41.956 --> 00:01:42.984
(gasping)

00:01:42.984 --> 00:01:43.900
(clattering)

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.203
It's beginning to crack.

00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:49.310
(clinking repeatedly)

00:01:51.238 --> 00:01:52.410
(light jazzy music)

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.370
Oh my God.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:54.450
The membrane!

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.520
Why is it so full?

00:01:56.544 --> 00:01:57.377
Ah!

00:01:57.994 --> 00:01:59.994
I don't know what to do.

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:01.495
Oh.

00:02:01.938 --> 00:02:04.938
(light jazzy music.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.045
- [Man] It's gonna be
a crunchy Egg McMuffin.

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:09.878
- Oh!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:11.493
I'm shaking.

00:02:11.804 --> 00:02:13.069
(gasping)

00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:16.069
(light jazzy music)

00:02:19.491 --> 00:02:20.324
Ta-da!

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:23.020
It looks like egg?

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:24.320
That was the hardest part.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:26.190
I'm gonna pour this in the mold now.

00:02:26.408 --> 00:02:27.455
(laughing)

00:02:27.455 --> 00:02:28.630
I'm gonna put it in the oven, okay?

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.003
Oh my God, it's leaking.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.093
Oh my God.

00:02:31.553 --> 00:02:34.240
(big band music)

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.833
We're gonna go with 350.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.023
Make it a little lower.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.323
Okay, let's check on that later.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:42.480
We're going to transfer
this huge piece of bread

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:43.710
to the cast iron.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.213
How does one transfer this?

00:02:45.218 --> 00:02:46.051
Ah.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.813
No, no, no, flip it.

00:02:50.589 --> 00:02:51.422
(laughing)

00:02:51.422 --> 00:02:53.123
Wow, that was a complete
and utter failure.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.950
We're just gonna wait now,

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.413
until it becomes golden brown.

00:02:57.837 --> 00:03:00.837
(light jazzy music)

00:03:01.623 --> 00:03:02.913
I think it's about that time.

00:03:04.289 --> 00:03:05.206
Look at it!

00:03:07.945 --> 00:03:08.778
Yay!

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.263
Wow.

00:03:13.642 --> 00:03:14.475
Wah!

00:03:14.475 --> 00:03:16.783
Put it on this heated baking sheet.

00:03:18.357 --> 00:03:21.357
(light jazzy music)

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:23.650
I'll put it in the oven.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.483
Bye-bye.

00:03:25.474 --> 00:03:26.641
See you later.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.823
It's all coming together now.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:31.097
Beautiful ostrich egg.

00:03:31.986 --> 00:03:32.819
I'm so excited.

00:03:32.819 --> 00:03:34.190
(clanging)

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.000
So while I'm waiting
for these to cool down,

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.193
I am going to pan fry
these super thick cut,

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.381
by thick, I mean, damn, this is thick.

00:03:42.381 --> 00:03:43.464
Check it out!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.843
Perfect for a giant Egg McMuffin.

00:03:47.648 --> 00:03:49.269
(sizzling)

00:03:49.269 --> 00:03:50.102
Huh!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:54.610
Okay, so you're only supposed
to open these with a fork,

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:58.250
so I found a giant fork-ish thing.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.083
Let's try.

00:03:59.345 --> 00:04:02.345
(light jazzy music)

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.403
Ooh.

00:04:04.587 --> 00:04:07.355
(mimicking fanfare)

00:04:07.355 --> 00:04:08.605
English muffin!

00:04:09.967 --> 00:04:10.903
I'm so happy!

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.230
So we're gonna butter these slices up,

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.883
make it extra greasy, extra yummy.

00:04:16.071 --> 00:04:16.904
Hey, hey.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.273
And these are going back in the oven.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.910
So we're gonna do the
most important part now.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:27.013
For research purposes,
the original Egg McMuffin.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:31.330
You see the bread on top,
the ham, the egg, the cheese.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.650
So that's how we're gonna build ours.

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:33.483
Here we go.

00:04:34.239 --> 00:04:35.072
Ta-da.

00:04:35.072 --> 00:04:37.210
I could not find a giant piece of cheese,

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.633
so we're gonna have to do this one by one.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.913
This is the moment we've been waiting for.

00:04:42.069 --> 00:04:45.069
(imitating fanfare)

00:04:45.228 --> 00:04:47.530
Wow, how do you take this off?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:48.803
Whoa!

00:04:49.437 --> 00:04:51.603
Now we're gonna put the ham.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:52.533
Ta-da!

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.193
And we're gonna cover it up.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.233
And this, my friends, is the beautiful,

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.323
giant Egg McMuffin.

00:05:00.347 --> 00:05:03.030
The only thing missing is
that we need to get the cheese

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.870
just like this, super melty.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.213
Dun-dun-dun.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.193
Wow!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.503
Original one.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.975
It looks kinda alike, right?

00:05:10.975 --> 00:05:11.808
(laughing)

00:05:11.808 --> 00:05:12.641
Wow, guys.

00:05:12.641 --> 00:05:13.474
I did it.

00:05:13.474 --> 00:05:15.150
I didn't think I would be
able to do it, but I did it.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:18.060
The real test is does it taste like it?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:18.893
We don't know.

00:05:18.893 --> 00:05:22.173
I'm gonna have my friends and
my coworkers reveal the truth.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.193
I'm nervous.

00:05:23.399 --> 00:05:26.283
(jazzy big band music)

00:05:26.283 --> 00:05:29.866
(group gasping and ah-ing)

00:05:30.676 --> 00:05:31.509
- Oh, yes.

00:05:31.509 --> 00:05:33.734
This thing itself is the
size of an Egg McMuffin.

00:05:33.734 --> 00:05:36.155
(whimsical big band music)

00:05:36.155 --> 00:05:37.593
It tastes exactly like an Egg McMuffin.

00:05:37.593 --> 00:05:38.426
- Yay!

00:05:40.447 --> 00:05:44.030
(whimsical big band music)

00:05:44.174 --> 00:05:45.341
Yay, I did it!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.353
Until next time.

00:05:48.802 --> 00:05:49.635
Bye-bye.

00:05:49.962 --> 00:05:53.545
(whimsical big band music)

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.980
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new channel.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.690
And now your part.
- Subscribe here.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.640
- That was my part.

